## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Routing gate (new skill) created and callable
- [ ] Lug schema extended (both `status` and `queue_state` present)
- [ ] WAI-State.json has `_work_queue` section (can be empty initially)
- [ ] Wakeup displays queue at Step 9 with ready/needs_refinement distinction
- [ ] Closeout Step 10 marks jobs done and token-checks before auto-load
- [ ] First run auto-discovers queue from existing lugs (discovers ~47 items)
- [ ] Auto-mode chains jobs with minimal context (~20k tokens verified)
- [ ] Track captures implementation_notes + uat_recording + queue_context
- [ ] Incomplete lugs default to needs_refinement (not skip/error)
- [ ] All 3 phases (routing + orchestration + discovery) work together

