## Known Limitations & Deferred

- **Parallel job execution:** Deferred (sequential only for now)
- **Cross-session auto-chains:** Deferred (single-session only)
- **Job dependency graphs:** Deferred (simple blocker_list only, no complex DAGs)
- **Hub lug inbox:** Deferred (signals route via bulletin, lug-to-lug routing deferred)

